## Implementing Traffic Light to Control the Vehicles

I implemented traffic lights to control the movement of vehicles based on their state 
(Green, Red, Yellow, None) - Yellow is not implemented fully yet.

```csharp
public void PassLightState(LightState state)
{
    Debug.Log("Passing light state to vehicle " + state);
    switch (state)
    {
        case LightState.Green:
            vehicleController.SetState<VehicleGoState>();
            break;
        case LightState.Red:
            vehicleController.SetState<VehicleStopState>();
            break;
        case LightState.Yellow:
            vehicleController.SetState<VehicleSlowDownState>();
            break;
        case LightState.None:
            break;
    }

    carLightState = state;
}
```

